flowchart TB
  OBJ[64MiB logical chunk] --> ENC[Rust EC Encoder 4+2]
  ENC --> DA[AZ-A Node-1 data shard]
  ENC --> DB[AZ-A Node-2 data shard]
  ENC --> DC[AZ-B Node-3 data shard]
  ENC --> DD[AZ-B Node-4 data shard]
  ENC --> PE[AZ-C Node-5 parity shard]
  ENC --> PF[AZ-C Node-6 parity shard]
  DA --> ACK[Required all 6 durable receipts]
  DB --> ACK
  DC --> ACK
  DD --> ACK
  PE --> ACK
  PF --> ACK
  ACK --> M[Raft Manifest Commit]
  M --> R[HTTP 2xx]
  NOTE[AZ lost: >=4 shards read viable, new writes fail closed until compliant layout available] -.-> ENC
